# Git-ignore driver binaries EXCEPT the shipped Apple driver, which users need
# in the download for a one-click install (see v1-binary-patch/README.md and
# DMCA-NOTICE.md).
*.sys
!v1-binary-patch/apple-driver/applewirelessmouse.sys
!v1-binary-patch/applewirelessmouse.sys
!v1-binary-patch/installer/applewirelessmouse.sys

# Certificates EXCEPT release/
*.cer
*.pfx
*.p12
!v1-binary-patch/MagicMouseFix.cer
!v1-binary-patch/installer/MagicMouseFix.cer

